=== A7 / fossil-reclaim leg 1 -- red-proof index ===

Base tree for every red proof below: 75e85b9 (the pins + fixes commit).

WHY MECHANISM-DISABLED REDS. A7 adds a NEW operation, so there is no tree in
which the pins compile and fail for want of the fix -- the red-first shape for
new work is therefore to disable exactly the mechanism a pin measures and watch
that pin, and only that pin, die. Each log embeds the disabling diff, the full
teed run, and TRUE EXIT.

Every log below ends with TRUE EXIT: 101.

01-red-preA7-operation-absent
    Disabled: the whole operation (the pre-A7 world -- every call answers as a
    node with no such route would).
    RED (11): a_live_binding / a_retired_identity / an_open_detach_replay_cell /
    a_live_enrollment_receipt / the_fossil_shape / a_generation_mismatch /
    a_repeated_reissue / an_unknown_participant / a_live_attach_receipt /
    the_reissue_appends_exactly_one_row / the_reissue_row_replays.
    STAYED GREEN, correctly: without_a_reissue_the_fossil_stays_refused_forever
    (it is the CONTROL -- it pins the pre-A7 truth and must survive this), both
    source audits, and an_unknown_conversation (the disabled operation happens
    to answer that same row, which is exactly why 06 exists).

