08b-red-detach-replay-cell-trap-revealed
    The same arm deleted AND the pin's refusal assertion replaced by the commit
    the missing guard permits, so the TRAP is what fails. The re-entry attach
    dies at:
      "protocol attach transition failed: DetachCellAuthority"
    carried as ParticipantDispatch::Fatal -- the client receives NO FRAME AT
    ALL. This is the evidence behind the contract flag.

09-red-replay-missing-log-head-advance
    Disabled: advance_log_head in the replay arm.
    RED: the_reissue_row_replays_identically_across_both_crash_boundaries, at
      "sequence conflict: expected 6, actual 7"
    -- note the credential assertions PASS in this run. A replay pin that stops
