10-red-no-polling-audit-sees-a-real-wait
    A real std::thread::sleep introduced into the operation.
    RED: the_reissue_operation_introduces_no_timer_sweep_or_retry_loop
    (the audit's own inline positive control, against a file that provably
    polls, runs FIRST inside the pin on every ordinary run)

11-red-withheld-control-positive-control
    The withheld control handed the credential the SERVER holds, which provably
    binds.
    RED: without_a_reissue_the_fossil_stays_refused_forever
    This is what makes that pin a measurement rather than a vacuous predicate:
    its instrument is proved able to detect a bindable credential.

